  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 316.07 Background Investigation Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 316.07 Background Investigation Fee. Pursuant to Env-Sw 310 and upon presentation of an accounting and request for payment from the NHDOJ, the applicant shall pay the cost incurred by the NHDOJ to complete the background investigation and prepare a report to the department as required in RSA 149-M:9, III and IX.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 316.08) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)\n\nAppendix",
